# Session state and captured traffic. A MAX session file carries a live token for the owner's
# personal account, and a raw capture carries private messages and phone numbers; neither is ever
# committed, not even redacted-by-hand. Sanitized fixtures live in fixtures/ and are synthetic.
/session/
*.session
/captures/
# bin/max keeps a worktree's own config, state and cache here.
/.max/

# Plans, the session journal, the handoff and the cleanup list: the working trail, kept on the
# machine doing the work. Everything that explains what this is and how it is built stays in
# docs/ and is committed.
/docs_ai/

# Per-machine Claude Code state; a shared settings.json would be committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
